# The context of devtools-ui/Dockerfile, which is the repo root. Everything is left out except the root manifests
# and the workspace packages the UI runs on; a package the UI starts to depend on is added here, or the build fails
# at `tsc --build` naming it.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!application
!brewer
!devtools
!devtools-ui
!di
!html
!http
!static
!std

# What the build excludes anyway (tsconfig.build.json), or produces itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/_tests
**/_testdata
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test-d.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.testkit.ts
**/*.e2e.ts
**/vitest.config.ts
**/vitest.*.config.ts
**/*.md
di/examples
devtools-ui/Dockerfile
devtools-ui/Dockerfile.dockerignore
